Build a complete, production-ready School & College Management System.

This must be a REAL SOFTWARE PRODUCT, not a demo, prototype, landing page, concept UI, or AI-looking template.

The final application should look like a professionally developed commercial education-management platform that a real school, college, university, or educational institution could actually use.

IMPORTANT:
- Do NOT use fake/demo student records.
- Do NOT preload random students, teachers, parents, fees, attendance, marks, notices, etc.
- Do NOT create fake statistics just to make the dashboard look populated.
- Do NOT use lorem ipsum.
- Do NOT use "John Doe", "Test Student", "Demo User", or similar placeholder records.
- Do NOT create fake charts with invented numbers.
- Do NOT show fake notifications.
- Do NOT create fake transactions.
- Do NOT hard-code business data into the frontend.
- Every operational record must come from the database.
- Empty database states must look intentional and professional.
- Users must be able to create/import their own real institutional data.
- All forms must actually save, update, validate, and delete data where appropriate.
- All dashboard statistics must be calculated from real database records.
- All modules must be connected to the same database.
- Do not build disconnected screens.

The application must be scalable enough to support both schools and colleges.

